text":"演技，是摆脱比武的最佳手段。","hasText":true,"duration":3.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06456648BEEF61000183434393037333632.mp3"},{"id":"06765648BEEF61000183239303739373937","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_击杀语音1","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"又解决一个麻烦。","hasText":true,"duration":3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06765648BEEF61000183239303739373937.mp3"},{"id":"06168648BEEF61000183132313638343839","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_开场语音3","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"和风细雨，正适合结束后去庄周老师家摸鱼。","hasText":true,"duration":6.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06168648BEEF61000183132313638343839.mp3"},{"id":"06758648BEEF61000183435323339363033","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_开场语音1","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"很好，夫子不在，可以为所欲为了?","hasText":true,"duration":7.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06758648BEEF61000183435323339363033.mp3"},{"id":"06876648BEEF51000183136323632333933","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_复活语音1","category":"复活","seq":null,"text":"嗯,下次争取演得更像一点……","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06876648BEEF51000183136323632333933.mp3"},{"id":"06105648BEEF51000183136383633363433","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_死亡语音1","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"啊……到此为止了吗……嘎","hasText":true,"duration":3.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06105648BEEF51000183136383633363433.mp3"},{"id":"06650648BEEF51000183630383930373332","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_移动语音12","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"拯救天下别找我，我的心太小，只够照见身边的人。","hasText":true,"duration":5.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06650648BEEF51000183630383930373332.mp3"},{"id":"06186648BEEF51000183138313037393134","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_死亡语音2","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"不愧是你……啊...","hasText":true,"duration":5.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06186648BEEF51000183138313037393134.mp3"},{"id":"06551648BEEF41000183136353132313138","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_移动语音9","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"人生很长，遇事莫慌。","hasText":true,"duration":5.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06551648BEEF41000183136353132313138.mp3"},{"id":"06272648BEEF41000183130373532333133","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_移动语音6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"对自己严苛的人，怎么可能对他人宽容。","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06272648BEEF41000183130373532333133.mp3"},{"id":"06541648BEEF41000183639303536343631","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_移动语音8","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"不是偷懒，这叫做……灵活变通地努力。","hasText":true,"duration":5.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06541648BEEF41000183639303536343631.mp3"},{"id":"06815648BEEF41000183236373435383437","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_移动语音11","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"海都确实热闹，但稷下学院是家——人总是要回家的。","hasText":true,"duration":7.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06815648BEEF41000183236373435383437.mp3"},{"id":"06122648BEEF41000183133353032383333","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_移动语音10","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"做自己内心的君主，胜过众望所归的英雄。","hasText":true,"duration":5.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06122648BEEF41000183133353032383333.mp3"},{"id":"06518648BEEF41000183337323430333535","heroId":"830","skinId":"831","skinName":"武道奇才","title":"姬小满_武道奇才_移动语音7","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"哼哼哼，哼哼哼，哼????","hasText":true,"duration":7.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/830/06518648BEEF41000183337323430333535.mp3"},{"id":"06386648BEEF